== Effects ==
* Grants Isaac one {{E|Black Heart}}.
* Spawns three {{E|Bomb}}s near Isaac.
** The bombs can be of any type that can naturally spawn, including {{E|Troll Bomb}}s and {{E|Mega Troll Bomb}}s. They spawn with their usual drop chance.
* {{dlc|r}} Outside of [[Greed Mode]], spawns the {{t|Match Stick}} if it hasn't yet been encountered.

== Synergies ==
* {{T|Black Feather}}: Black Feather grants a damage boost for Match Book.

